{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/118966","id":3585642443,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7VuI_L","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118966","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118966.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118966.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118966","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/118966/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/118966/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118966/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/fe35008c4e2c8fa699995421a2ad0214d98faad7","number":118966,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"🤖 macOS: Discard OS-injected phantom mouseMoved events that break fullscreen UI clicks","user":{"login":"gregod-com","id":42735464,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQyNzM1NDY0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/42735464?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gregod-com","html_url":"https://github.com/gregod-com","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gregod-com/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gregod-com/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gregod-com/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gregod-com/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gregod-com/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gregod-com/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gregod-com/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gregod-com/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gregod-com/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## Summary\n\nOn **macOS 26 (Tahoe)**, clicking any editor UI button (Run, Stop, 2D/3D/Script tabs, etc.) while the editor is in fullscreen mode silently fails. The button visually reacts to the press but does not activate on release. Keyboard shortcuts for the same actions work fine.\n\n## Root cause\n\nAfter every real `mouseDown:` in fullscreen, macOS injects one or two synthetic `NSEvent` `mouseMoved:` events with **stale, off-cursor coordinates**. These phantom events reach `BaseButton::gui_input` motion handling, which calls `has_point(position)` on the stale position — evaluating to `false` — and clears `pressing_inside`. On release, the guard `press_attempt && pressing_inside` then fails, so the button never activates.\n\nInstrumentation confirmed that **Godot does not issue any `CGWarpMouseCursorPosition` call** on this code path; the events are purely OS-generated (a macOS Tahoe regression). The phantoms are reliably identified by: `subtype == NSEventSubtypeMouseEvent (0)`, `deviceID == 0`, `delta == (0, 0)`.\n\n## Fix\n\nDiscard `mouseMoved:` events matching that signature when the window is in fullscreen mode. A stationary cursor never emits a real `mouseMoved` event, so the guard is safe.\n\n## Testing\n\n- Confirmed bug present on macOS 26 / M1 Max with Godot 4.6-stable and master.\n- Confirmed fix resolves Run, Stop, 2D/3D/Script tabs, and ConfirmationDialog buttons in fullscreen.\n- Windowed mode unaffected.\n\n> [!INFO] *AI disclosure*: This contribution was authored by an autonomous AI agent (GitHub Copilot), on behalf of the user Gregor Pirolt, who reproduced the bug, guided the investigation, and verified the fix.","labels":[{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","description":"","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":6051509301,"node_id":"LA_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABaLK0NQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/spam","name":"spam","description":"","color":"E94A26","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-04-26T12:53:13Z","updated_at":"2026-04-26T13:00:25Z","closed_at":"2026-04-26T12:53:46Z","merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"2f2e14ee97944b97c418748bd688c846ff93319b","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"gregod-com:fix/macos-fullscreen-phantom-mousemoved","ref":"fix/macos-fullscreen-phantom-mousemoved","repo":{"id":1221601235,"node_id":"R_kgDOSNAn0w","name":"godot","full_name":"gregod-com/godot","owner":{"login":"gregod-com","id":42735464,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQyNzM1NDY0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/42735464?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gregod-com","html_url":"https://github.com/gregod-com","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gregod-com/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gregod-com/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gregod-com/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gregod-com/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gregod-com/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gregod-com/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gregod-com/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gregod-com/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gregod-com/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"private":false,"fork":true,"archived":false,"disabled":false,"description":"Godot Engine – Multi-platform 2D and 3D game engine","homepage":"https://godotengine.org","language":null,"visibility":"public","is_template":false,"topics":[],"forks_count":0,"forks":0,"stargazers_count":0,"watchers_count":0,"watchers":0,"open_issues_count":0,"open_issues":0,"size":1799679,"default_branch":"master","has_issues